TurnHandling.PlayPlayerTurns: an exception in one AI or barbarian player's turn is logged and ends that player's turn, instead of aborting everyone else's moves (or stalling the game on that turn forever). DefenderAI.FindAtRiskCityToDefend: skip a destination city that has changed hands (the KeyNotFoundException that stalled long games).

